{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"items\": [\n    {\n      \"text\": \"追问对方能否理解的急切忽然退远，他先落进小心而近乎静止的安宁。\",\n      \"follows\": false,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B3\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M6\", \"M7\", \"M12\", \"M13\", \"M31\", \"M35\", \"M43\", \"M53\", \"M57\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"反复加力仍不能确认对方的回应，持续紧绷又先耗尽了他的力气。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B1\", \"B2\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M1\", \"M7\", \"M13\", \"M31\", \"M35\", \"M43\", \"M53\", \"M57\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"安静持续后，他暂时不只想着自己是否被理解，也感到对方本身带来的温暖。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M3\", \"M5\", \"M16\", \"M18\", \"M27\", \"M28\", \"M44\", \"M54\", \"M56\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他已知道加力逼不来对方回应；追问暂歇，才有余地单纯地惦念对方。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M7\", \"M17\", \"M18\", \"M27\", \"M28\", \"M30\", \"M41\", \"M44\", \"M54\", \"M56\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"后半温柔与牵挂一度涌得很满，不舍也浮出来，末尾像一句话没说完。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M3\", \"M15\", \"M23\", \"M33\", \"M37\", \"M38\", \"M46\", \"M58\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    },\n    {\n      \"text\": \"他知道亲近不能让过去复原，也逼不来对方回应；这段安静正流走，话便停在未完处。\",\n      \"follows\": true,\n      \"from\": [\"S01\", \"S05\"],\n      \"explains\": [\"B2\", \"B3\", \"B5\"],\n      \"basis\": {\n        \"M\": [\"M15\", \"M23\", \"M33\", \"M37\", \"M45\", \"M46\", \"M50\", \"M58\"],\n        \"orig\": []\n      }\n    }\n  ],\n  \"new\": [\n    \"他发现，即使对方没有回应，心里的亲近仍能真实发生。\",\n    \"他开始把注意力从自己是否被理解，移向对方本身带来的温暖。\",\n    \"他发现，静静感受这份亲近不能让此刻停住，反而使时间流逝变得具体。\"\n  ],\n  \"gaps\": []\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "b7b6b1ae-d979-4c4a-b762-33a395bc2b5d", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T234004012493Z", "elapsed_seconds": 157.422, "completed_utc": "2026-10-28T23:42:41.440040+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "29b86821fd3db141bfbbf15961974fea37344c9f7a444f08437ea43d6cad31f9", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "yi/local-codex-auth", "account_sha256": "b3efb6361563c139233ed7b7ef61a7c9afe0bd48d4eb3525dbe31956b024d6da", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "5968886fe255f06b948842c8a649fd0127f8ddec9fc4958701d80251c394b449", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_attachments.py": "eedfa23885000025700f6306b1d1f4582896a7370734be506c156dee532fd7d7"}}, "screenshot_evidence": {"complete": true, "kind": "offline_actual_HTTP_response", "directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt3\\pro-bridge-20261028T234004012493Z", "files": ["proof-offline.png"], "sha256": {"proof-offline.png": "8bdf0c4a32aa26eee8